格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Model Router and GALGame plugin for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1353534254","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-model-router","slug":"Alice-Marx/dsh-model-router","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Model Router and GALGame plugin for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Bot · Model Router"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ljwei-stak/dsh-model-route-bot) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ljwei-stak/dsh-model-router) [](https://dshfind.com/en/plugins/Alice-Marx/dsh-model-router?ref=badge"},{"id":"p4s3","text":") [](https://dshfind.com/en/plugins/Alice-Marx/dsh-model-router?ref=badge) [](https://dsh-plugin.org"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"/plugins/alice-marx/dsh-model-router) [](https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com)"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Model routing and a persistent Bot workspace for DeepSeek Harness.**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Turn a task into a reviewable execution plan, select suitable configured models or native CLI tools,"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" and follow the results in one workspace. Add the full Bot edition for long-running conversations, m"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ulti-Bot delegation, private files, and your own Windows computers."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"This is a community plugin. It reuses Harness model configuration and Host services; each provider o"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"r CLI uses its own account and access rights."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**Current stable version: 0.66.4 · Windows Remote Agent: 0.1.1**"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Choose an edition · Install · First task · Bot delegation · Remote computers · Support"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Choose the workspace you need"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Edition | Package to enter in **Plugins → Add plugin** | What it adds |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| **DSH Bot + Model Router** | `@ljwei-stak/dsh-model-route-bot` | The full Bot workspace, model-rou"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ting workbench, Bot delegation, remote computers, private libraries, and routines. |\n| **Model Route"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"r** | `@ljwei-stak/dsh-model-router` | A **Model Router** entry in the standard Harness interface, w"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ith route planning, tools, execution, and accounting. DS Bot is not installed. |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Use **one edition per Harness profile**. Both editions share the routing configuration. To switch, r"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"emove the existing package entry in plugin management, add the other edition in the same profile, an"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"d retain your data directories and configured Bot home. Routing-only guide."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Capabilities at a glance"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Workflow | What you can do | Edition |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Task-oriented model routing | Start from a task template; compare economy, balanced, or quality-fi"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"rst plans; use one route, a dependency-based team, or an exact model. | Both |\n| Reviewable executio"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"n | Inspect models, tools, workspace, permissions, and estimates before confirming; track progress, "},{"id":"p16s4","text":"results, cancellation, and supported retries. | Both |\n| Native CLI tools | Detect and install regis"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"tered tools, check login and mode readiness, and open an interactive terminal. | Both |\n| Budgets an"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"d feedback | Set API limits, track reservations and receipts, inspect subscription calls/tokens sepa"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"rately, and use optional reviews and explicit ratings. | Both |\n| Persistent Bot conversations | Giv"},{"id":"p16s8","text":"e each Bot its own model, role, work directory, private chat, and permissions; handle side chats, qu"},{"id":"p16s9","text":"estions, and approval cards. | Full Bot |\n| Groups and shared context | Use mentions, staged group g"},{"id":"p16s10","text":"oals, handoffs, conversation search/checkpoints, and Bot/group/team memory with revision history. | "},{"id":"p16s11","text":"Full Bot |\n| Browser and document work | Use per-Bot browser partitions, supported Office reading/pr"},{"id":"p16s12","text":"eviews, connectors, credential cards, avatars, and team appearance settings. | Full Bot |\n| Schedule"},{"id":"p16s13","text":"d work | Schedule a target Bot or group through the Host's Automation tasks service. | Full Bot |\n| "},{"id":"p16s14","text":"Bot-to-Bot routing | Let a Main Bot select an eligible execution Bot from committed model, tool, com"},{"id":"p16s15","text":"puter, and funding settings, then dispatch real tasks. | Full Bot |\n| Windows computers and routines"},{"id":"p16s16","text":" | Pair your own computer, watch or control its desktop, record confirmed input, and replay saved ro"},{"id":"p16s17","text":"utines. | Full Bot |\n| Private file libraries | Organize files per Bot, upload/download binary files"},{"id":"p16s18","text":", edit text, and search private text with line-level results. | Full Bot |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"1. Open **Plugins → Add plugin** in Harness Desktop and enter **one** package:\n- Full workspace: `@l"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"jwei-stak/dsh-model-route-bot@0.66.4`\n- Routing only: `@ljwei-stak/dsh-model-router@0.66.4`\n2. Enabl"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"e it, fully quit Harness **including its tray process**, then restart so the Host loads the installe"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"d version.\n3. Configure provider credentials and models in the official Harness **Models** settings."},{"id":"p18s5","text":" Open the Bot workspace for the full edition, or **Model Router** in the sidebar for the routing-onl"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"Bot workspace for the full edition, or **Model Router** in the sidebar for the routing-only edition."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"CLI installation is also supported. Choose the command for your edition:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Alternatively, import the matching `.tgz` from GitHub Releases. For an extracted local package, sele"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ct the inner `package` directory containing `package.json` and `.dsh-plugin`. A global npm installat"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ion alone does not register a Harness plugin."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Complete your first task"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The model-routing workbench is available in both editions. In the full Bot workspace, open **Advance"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ing workbench is available in both editions. In the full Bot workspace, open **Advanced workbench**."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"1. **Prepare a model.** Add a working provider/model in Harness. In **Model configuration**, refresh"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" routes and enter known prices and capabilities. Leave unknown information blank.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Integration, data, and compatibility"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The Host owns committed model, tool, computer, funding, and operation identity. Bot dispatch, model-"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"originated tools, and owner workbench actions follow this authority. Worktree isolation organizes co"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"de changes; vendor-native processes use the current user's system access."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Provider credentials and authenticated sessions are managed by Harness. Routing state, receipts, com"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"mitted Bot bindings, private libraries, and routine ledgers live under `<DSH_HOME>/model-router/`. T"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"he configured Bot home stores upstream conversations, memory, browser state, and team files. Agent c"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"onfiguration and pairing credentials remain on the controlled computer. Back up these locations befo"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"re changing runtime ownership; keep pairing files, recordings, logs, and private files out of public"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"ng runtime ownership; keep pairing files, recordings, logs, and private files out of public reports."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Component | Current scope |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Harness integration | Declared Host versions are listed in package.json; integration verification "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"uses the actual Harness SDK **0.2.2-rc.1**. |\n| Bot foundation | Pinned DS Bot **0.2.7**, with proje"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"ct-specific integration and product overlays. |\n| Remote desktop | Windows x64 Agent **0.1.1**, with"},{"id":"p29s4","text":" an available signed-in interactive desktop. |\n| Tool execution | Availability depends on the local "},{"id":"p29s5","text":"platform, installed CLI, account, exact model, and supported execution adapter shown by the workbenc"},{"id":"p29s6","text":"form, installed CLI, account, exact model, and supported execution adapter shown by the workbench. |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
